id: as-09-glass
number: 409
name: Glass
description: Two Archers and two Threadcasters, and nobody who can stand in front of anyone. Every unit dies to two hits and the Grappler picks Archers on purpose.
design: Asymmetry 9 — missing tools. No Vanguard and no Wardbearer anywhere.
design: Four units, eight HP each, thirty-two hit points on the whole board. Nothing shoves 2, and with no Wardbearer there is no Guard Stance and so no body to hide behind.

